cial_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5004790-1845383656385423","game_id":"steam-5004790","kind":"announcement","title":"The \"HIJURA SCARLET GEAR\" Demo has been updated! Give it a play and let me know","summary":"The \"HIJURA SCARLET GEAR\" Demo has been updated! Give it a play and let me know what you think!\\Added muzzle flashes and weapon recoil for the player character.Fine-tuned melee attacks and the dash mechanic.Implemented various character voices and story cutscenes.Overhauled the Stage 2 boss: \"Tower Kong\".Added the Stage 3 boss: \"Mechanical Fish\".Rebalanced the Stage 4 boss: \"Shurei Walker\".Extra lives (Extends) granted every 100,000 points.Overall playability and quality-of-life improvements.Sin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T08:34:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385423","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5004790-1843481262699804","game_id":"steam-5004790","kind":"update","title":"【Demo Update】HIJURA Demo - Sep 12 Patch Live!","summary":"The HIJURA demo has been updated! Give it a play and check out what's new!◆ Key UpdatesWeapon Icons Implemented: Clearer UI showing your currently selected weapon and selection order.Player Movement & Actions Adjusted: Dash and Melee attacks now feature a 3-tier charge system (charges 1 gauge every 0.7s, up to 3 max for massive damage). Voice cues (\"1, 2, 3!\") help track your charge level.Full Power Mode Added: Stacking 5 or more health (starting from 3) triggers Full Power Mode—granting 5 secon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T16:30:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699804","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","con